B.VI=new A.aX("What do defenders of traditional education emphasize?",B.Qz,1,'They argue universities provide "critical thinking, exposure to diverse perspectives, and formation of lifelong networks."')
B.Qf=s(["People live longer","Automation and AI transform job markets","Universities require it","It is cheaper"],t.s)
B.Vx=new A.aX("Why is lifelong learning becoming necessary?",B.Qf,1,'"As automation and AI transform job markets, workers will need to continuously update their skills."')
